---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Karaté" description="Karaté no Grupo Sportivo de Carcavelos — Arte marcial japonesa para todas as idades.">
  <!-- Hero with Image -->
  <section class="sport-hero">
    <div class="sport-hero__bg">
      <img src="/images/sports/karate-action.jpg" alt="Karaté GSC" loading="eager" />
      <div class="sport-hero__overlay"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="container sport-hero__content">
      <span class="badge badge--hero reveal">Karaté</span>
      <h1 class="text-h1 reveal reveal-delay-1">
        Karaté <span class="sport-hero__highlight">GSC</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="sport-hero__desc reveal reveal-delay-2">Arte marcial japonesa para todas as idades e níveis.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Main Image -->
  <section class="section--sm" style="margin-top: -60px; position: relative; z-index: 2;">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="sport-main-image reveal-scale">
        <img src="/images/sports/karate.jpg" alt="Karaté" loading="eager" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- About -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container container--md">
      <div class="content-block reveal">
        <p class="text-body-lg">
          O karaté é uma arte marcial japonesa que combina disciplina mental com técnica física. No GSC, a prática do karaté está aberta a todas as idades e níveis de experiência, desde iniciantes a praticantes avançados.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Values -->
  <section class="section bg-grid">
    <div class="container container--md">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="badge">Valores</span>
        <h2 class="text-h2">Os Valores do <span class="text-gradient">Karaté</span></h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid--3">
        <div class="card step-card reveal">
          <div class="step-card__header">
            <div class="step-card__icon step-card__icon--amber">
              <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
            </div>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-h4">Disciplina</h3>
          <p class="text-secondary">Desenvolvimento da autodisciplina e da concentração através da prática regular.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card step-card reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <div class="step-card__header">
            <div class="step-card__icon step-card__icon--green">
              <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
            </div>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-h4">Respeito</h3>
          <p class="text-secondary">Respeito pelo mestre, pelos colegas e pela tradição da arte marcial.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card step-card reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <div class="step-card__header">
            <div class="step-card__icon step-card__icon--violet">
              <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
            </div>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-h4">Técnica</h3>
          <p class="text-secondary">Aperfeiçoamento contínuo das técnicas de kata, kumite e defesa pessoal.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Training Info -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container container--md">
      <div class="info-notice reveal">
        <div class="info-notice__icon">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12" y2="12"/><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12.01" y2="8"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-h4">Horários de Treino</h3>
          <p class="text-secondary">Os horários de treino de karaté serão atualizados em breve. Para mais informações, contacte o clube.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .sport-hero {
    position: relative;
    padding-top: calc(var(--header-height) + var(--space-24));
    padding-bottom: var(--space-32);
    overflow: hidden;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .sport-hero__bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .sport-hero__bg img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .sport-hero__overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.5) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.7) 100%);
  }

  .sport-hero__content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  .sport-hero__content .text-h1 { color: #ffffff; }

  .sport-hero__highlight {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fbbf24 0%, #f59e0b 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }

  .sport-hero__desc {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
    font-size: var(--fs-body-lg);
    max-width: 560px;
  }

  .badge--hero {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    color: #ffffff;
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  }

  .sport-main-image {
    border-radius: var(--radius-2xl);
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-xl);
    aspect-ratio: 21 / 9;
  }

  .sport-main-image img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .content-block {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .content-block p {
    line-height: var(--lh-relaxed);
  }

  .info-notice {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    padding: var(--space-6);
    background: var(--color-accent-muted);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-accent);
  }

  .info-notice__icon {
    color: var(--color-accent-text);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .info-notice h3 { margin-bottom: var(--space-2); }

  .info-notice p {
    font-size: var(--fs-small);
    line-height: var(--lh-relaxed);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .sport-hero {
      padding-top: calc(var(--header-height) + var(--space-16));
      padding-bottom: var(--space-24);
    }
    .sport-main-image { aspect-ratio: 16 / 10; }
  }
</style>
